<div class="vehicle-pricing-notice">
  <h3>Rental Pricing &amp; Fees</h3>
  <p>Vehicle cards show the weekly base rental rate and deposit. Standard rental rates do not include insurance;
    Uber Black rates include insurance. For vehicles with updated rates, the card also shows weekly totals with
    applicable fees and tax.</p>
  <p>A 4.2% processing fee applies to charges other than deposits through November 30, 2026. Starting December 1,
    2026, a combined 14.2% will apply to charges other than deposits (10% Virginia Motor Vehicle Rental Tax plus a
    4.2% processing fee). Deposits are not subject to these fees.</p>
</div>
